a bit more though. The chips were good and had a nice crunch. We enjoyed our smoothies and we were completely stuffed. Overall, I enjoyed the healthy options Good Bird offered and the staff we..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ILWv3aMVbZUMjcMSTGgStQ","photo_id":"03a_bxAdAAttXLz5VKlIfw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/03a_bxAdAAttXLz5VKlIfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
